class vsSteamSystem
    doc The engine's link to Steam.
    field 0x98 appId int
        doc The game's Steam app id (486860), as the constructor was given it.
        seen vsSteamSystem::vsSteamSystem(int)+0x4f
    method vsSteamSystem(int)
        param 1 appId
        doc Asks Steam whether the game was started through it (SteamAPI_RestartAppIfNecessary with the app id). When it wasn't, Steam starts it again and this copy quits: "[STEAM] Steam is restarting us.".
        doc So a debugger that starts MT2.exe itself loses the game, unless steam_appid.txt (with 486860) is next to MT2.exe. Attaching to the running game always works.
        seen vsSteamSystem::vsSteamSystem(int)+0x1e
        seen vsSteamSystem::vsSteamSystem(int)+0x1ce
        seen vsSteamSystem::vsSteamSystem(int)+0x1e2
